Compare the actual required behavior with the carrier's evidenced capability, including duration and transfer conditions. Ambient capacity does not satisfy refrigerated handling. Preserve an unclear capability or a class-specific reopening exclusion as a blocker; do not infer equivalence from a broad service name. Return the unmet or uncertain requirements.
